+// ===============================================================================================
+// ORO patch (l): the TEXTURED update. u,v ride nx/ny - the same SkpVtx channel the blit
+// paths use for texture coordinates (OrthoVS: tex.xy = dir.xy * gSize.xy, so u,v are in
